  "story_summary": "The Opus-reviewed admission window gave the hosted job time to start. The live rerun passed the five ancestry readbacks and eight isolation denials. The independent observer recorded all 30 assigned outcomes and verified all 74 native child lifecycles. Fourteen tests passed and sixteen failed. Fifteen IDs encountered transcript discovery failures, and the native process-custody test required a same-UID parent. The scoped run is HOLD. The earlier local guest could exercise local isolation but lacked a usable process observer. The hosted run supplied independent observation and exposed the remaining execution incompatibilities. #368 stays open and #355 remains blocked by #368.",
